hamsterdan-export
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the Hamsterdan evidence exporter
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan. It follows the behavior of src/hamsterdan/host/export.py,
and its test suite ports the upstream tests in
tests/unit/host/test_export.py.

